.TH CALCULATOR 1 "October 2026" "Calculator 1.0 Alpha 1" "SDE Suite"
.SH NAME
calculator \- native scientific calculator for SDE
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B calculator
.br
.B calculator --eval
.I expression
.RB [ --angle " deg|rad|grad" ]
.br
.B calculator --version
.SH DESCRIPTION
Calculator is a native GTK4 application using the embedded Scientific
Calculator engine by Raad Altaie. It supports operator precedence,
parentheses, scientific functions, angle modes, memory, answer reuse,
clipboard copy and a small persistent history. It runs offline.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI --eval " expression"
Evaluate an expression without opening a window. The default angle unit
is degrees. Invalid expressions and domain errors return a nonzero status.
.TP
.BI --angle " unit"
Use deg, rad or grad with --eval.
.TP
.B --version
Print Calculator's independent SDE build version.
.SH FILES
.I ~/.local/state/sde/calculator.ini
stores GUI preferences, memory and the last ten history records.
XDG_STATE_HOME is respected.
